  "each_manual_part_has_actual_content_vocabulary": true,
  "actual_cut_first_words": [
    {
      "en": "And you just imagine the sense of wonder in a baby when it first discovers that, merely by uttering a sound, it can get objects to move across a room as if by magic, and maybe even into its mouth.",
      "at": "it can get objects",
      "actual_first_word": "it",
      "source_ASR_indices": [
        181
      ],
      "source_real_word_window": [
        111.04,
        111.12
      ],
      "scope": "确认存在真实首词，非生产换屏时间；停顿/无停顿由正式prepare另核。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Now, we need to explain how and why this remarkable trait, you know, human’s ability to do things with language has evolved, and why did this trait evolve only in our species?",
      "at": "and why did this trait",
      "actual_first_word": "and",
      "source_ASR_indices": [
        222
      ],
      "source_real_word_window": [
        126.52,
        126.6
      ],
      "scope": "确认存在真实首词，非生产换屏时间；停顿/无停顿由正式prepare另核。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Okay, so what this tells us is that, contrary to the old saying, “monkey see, monkey do,” the surprise really is that all of the other animals really cannot do that—at least not very much.",
      "at": "the surprise really is",
      "actual_first_word": "the",
      "source_ASR_indices": [
        430
      ],
      "source_real_word_window": [
        205.12,
        205.2
      ],
      "scope": "确认存在真实首词，非生产换屏时间；停顿/无停顿由正式prepare另核。"
    },
    {
      "en": "And this cumulative cultural adaptation, as anthropologists call this accumulation of ideas, is responsible for everything around you in your bustling and teeming everyday life.",
      "at": "is responsible for everything",
      "actual_first_word": "is",
      "source_ASR_indices": [
        521
      ],
      "source_real_word_window": [
        245.72,
        245.8
      ],
      "scope": "确认存在真实首词，非生产换屏时间；停顿/无停顿由正式prepare另核。"
    },
    {
      "en": "For instance, the chairs you’re sitting in today, the lights in this lecture hall, my microphone, the iPads and the smartphones that you carry around with you—all are a result of cumulative cultural adaptation.",
      "at": "the iPads and the",
      "actual_first_word": "the",
      "source_ASR_indices": [
        581
      ],
      "source_real_word_window": [
        272.16,
        272.24
      ],
      "scope": "确认存在真实首词，非生产换屏时间；停顿/无停顿由正式prepare另核。"
    },
    {
      "en": "But our acquisition of social learning would create an evolutionary dilemma, and the solution to the dilemma, it’s fair to say, would determine not only the future course of our psychology, but the future course of the entire world.",
      "at": "it’s fair to say,",
      "actual_first_word": "it’s",
      "source_ASR_indices": [
        618
      ],
      "source_real_word_window": [
        288.84,
        289.08
      ],
      "scope": "确认存在真实首词，非生产换屏时间；停顿/无停顿由正式prepare另核。"
    },
    {
      "en": "What I mean is, if I can learn by watching you, I can steal your best ideas, and I can benefit from your efforts, without having to put in the same time and energy that you did into developing them.",
      "at": "without having to put",
      "actual_first_word": "without",
      "source_ASR_indices": [
        693
      ],
      "source_real_word_window": [
        317.6,
        317.92
      ],
      "scope": "确认存在真实首词，非生产换屏时间；停顿/无停顿由正式prepare另核。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Choosing this option would mean that a vastly greater fund of knowledge and wisdom would become available to any one individual than would ever arise from within an individual family or an individual person on their own.",
      "at": "than would ever arise",
      "actual_first_word": "than",
      "source_ASR_indices": [
        791
      ],
      "source_real_word_window": [
        358.32,
        358.4
      ],
      "scope": "确认存在真实首词，非生产换屏时间；停顿/无停顿由正式prepare另核。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Language is a piece of social technology for enhancing the benefits of cooperation—for reaching agreements, for striking deals and for coordinating our activities.",
      "at": "for reaching agreements, for",
      "actual_first_word": "for",
      "source_ASR_indices": [
        835
      ],
      "source_real_word_window": [
        378.28,
        378.36
      ],
      "scope": "确认存在真实首词，非生产换屏时间；停顿/无停顿由正式prepare另核。"
    },
    {
      "en": "It seems that we use our language, not just to cooperate, but to draw rings around our cooperative groups and to establish identities, and perhaps to protect our knowledge and wisdom and skills from being stolen from outside.",
      "at": "and perhaps to protect",
      "actual_first_word": "and",
      "source_ASR_indices": [
        940
      ],
      "source_real_word_window": [
        424.32,
        424.4
      ],
      "scope": "确认存在真实首词，非生产换屏时间；停顿/无停顿由正式prepare另核。"
    },
    {
      "en": "And we know this because when we study different language groups and associate them with their cultures, we see that different languages slow the flow of ideas between groups.",
      "at": "we see that different",
      "actual_first_word": "we",
      "source_ASR_indices": [
        972
      ],
      "source_real_word_window": [
        436.84,
        436.92
      ],
      "scope": "确认存在真实首词，非生产换屏时间；停顿/无停顿由正式prepare另核。"
    },
    {
      "en": "What will be the solution, in a world in which we want to promote cooperation and exchange, and in a world that might be dependent more than ever before on cooperation to maintain and enhance our levels of prosperity?",
      "at": "and in a world",
      "actual_first_word": "and",
      "source_ASR_indices": [
        1086
      ],
      "source_real_word_window": [
        489.96,
        490.04
      ],
      "scope": "确认存在真实首词，非生产换屏时间；停顿/无停顿由正式prepare另核。"
    },
    {
      "en": "OK, in today’s lecture, I’ve presented to you how language shapes our humanity, what kind of dilemma social learning has created and the possible solutions to the dilemma.",
      "at": "what kind of dilemma",
      "actual_first_word": "what",
      "source_ASR_indices": [
        1154
      ],
      "source_real_word_window": [
        516.72,
        516.8
      ],
      "scope": "确认存在真实首词，非生产换屏时间；停顿/无停顿由正式prepare另核。"
    }
